(text "CONTINUOUS rotation, tendon spool" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 352.30 193.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e52925cb-0ac6-574b-ad38-a411bbb37a71"))
(text "WIRING NOTES  (what bit us, roughly in order of how much time it cost)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 22.86 203.20 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8829d02f-e3c2-5b44-9eb2-ccd88b04b0c9"))
(text "1. TMC2209 UART needs VS. VIO only powers the I/O ring; with no motor supply the driver never answers." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 22.86 207.50 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bfd5fca8-7fd8-5ca6-abda-1ed1a2cd21d6"))
(text "2. R7 on each StepStick bridged pad 2-3 so PDN_UART reaches header pin 4. Check: pin 4 to GND reads ~20k." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 22.86 211.80 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ee7c8336-31ff-5eaf-a6c2-77247378d3ad"))
(text "3. One 1k total, in the ESP32 TX line (GPIO17). RX (GPIO16) goes straight to the bus. One wire, half duplex." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 22.86 216.10 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5f1cf8f9-158f-518e-b18c-7238ac2cd734"))
(text "4. Bus address latched from MS1/MS2 at power-up: J1=0 (GND,GND), J2=1 (3V3,GND), J3=2 (GND,3V3). Max 4 per bus." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 22.86 220.40 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9bba37f7-69de-5e58-959b-139acc61eb91"))
(text "5. DIR is NOT wired: the DIR inputs on these modules are damaged. Direction = GCONF.shaft over UART (fw 1.2+)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 22.86 224.70 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2db7baa1-26e0-5b9a-8edf-3243859c96fc"))
(text "6. EN is active low and shared. The 10k pull-up keeps the motors limp while the ESP32 boots or reflashes." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 22.86 229.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2866f8d4-ef2c-549b-b9af-8da1938442d7"))
(text "7. CLK to GND = internal oscillator. Microstepping is set over UART (MRES); MS1/MS2 are address pins only." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 22.86 233.30 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d1d4cd2e-ab54-53f0-baff-70ab229e7e15"))
(text "8. Never plug or unplug a motor while VMOT is live - the back-EMF spike kills the driver." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 22.86 237.60 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "374b8094-d9d5-5457-8d63-82e3ed9fddb2"))
(text "9. Servos never take power from the dev board. Common GND between ESP32, motor PSU and servo PSU is mandatory." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 22.86 241.90 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5073ef3d-8df7-5e69-91f3-4b4d9018a39a"))
(text "10. GRIP is a continuous-rotation servo: pulse width = speed, ~1500 us = stop. See docs/calibration.md." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 22.86 246.20 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b5dd7c52-cf19-5dbf-a1c6-2dab3d587453"))
(text "11. 17HS4401S coils: usually black/green = A, red/blue = B. Confirm with a meter (a few ohms within a coil)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 22.86 250.50 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0508abec-607f-5b0f-900d-d1899045ef92"))
(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
(embedded_fonts no)
)
